# Dev: Vite proxies /api → API_PROXY_TARGET (default http://localhost:4000).
# Start the backend (`cd backend && npm run dev`) or you get ECONNREFUSED on /api/*.
# API_PROXY_TARGET=http://localhost:4000

# Production build: full API origin (no proxy). Leave empty only if same-origin.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-api.example.com
